e assumptions on which certain of such forward-looking statements are based, investors should keep in mind that the results, events or developments disclosed in any forward-looking statement made in this document may not occur, and that actual results may vary materially from those described herein, including those described as anticipated, expected, targeted, projected or otherwise."]},{"type":"p","children":["View source version on businesswire.com: https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20261014035676/en/"]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"BusinessWire","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"business_wire"}]},{"title":"Peruvian stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value":"PE"}]}],"robots":["noindex"],"copyright":"2026 Business Wire, Inc., All rights reserved.","id":"business_wire:1c51c87dd0aab:0","title":"Auna Reports Preliminary Key Performance Indicators for the Third Quarter ended September 30, 2026","published":1792067400,"urgency":2,"relatedSymbols":[{"symbol":"NYSE:AUNA","logoid":"auna-sa","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"auna-sa"}}],"storyPath":"/news/business_wire:1c51c87dd0aab:0-auna-reports-preliminary-key-performance-indicators-for-the-third-quarter-ended-september-30-2026/","read_time":219,"provider":{"id":"business_wire","name":"BusinessWire","logo_id":"business-wire"}}